---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AgentSandboxDemo from '../components/AgentSandboxDemo.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Consulting & Services" 
  description="Expert consulting on Agentic AI Infrastructure, Identity Boundaries, and Platform Engineering by Viswaroop Vadlamudi."
>
  <div class="py-12 md:py-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold font-heading mb-4 tracking-tight">Consulting & Services</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-400">
        Bridging the gap between robust platform infrastructure and the frontier of Agentic AI.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Demo Component at the top to capture attention -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <AgentSandboxDemo />
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 text-center mt-4 font-mono">Securing autonomous agents via strict identity boundaries.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <!-- Service 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-white/5 hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-3 text-white">Agentic AI Architecture Review</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          If you are building AI agents that execute workflows on behalf of users, you have a blast-radius problem. I review your architecture to ensure agents are properly scoped, executing in isolated sandboxes, and utilizing fine-grained M2M authorization.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mb-8 text-gray-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Review of execution sandboxes (Kubernetes, Firecracker)
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            OAuth2 scope mapping for autonomous behaviors
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Zanzibar policy review (OpenFGA, SpiceDB)
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:hello@viswaroop.dev?subject=Inquiry:%20Agentic%20AI%20Architecture" class="btn">Inquire</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-white/5 hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-3 text-white">Identity Platform Migration</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Managed identity providers (like Cognito or Auth0) break down when you need complex B2B multi-tenancy or customized SSO flows. I guide engineering teams through the migration to open-source API-first stacks (ORY ecosystem).
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 mb-8 text-gray-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Migration strategy and phase planning
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            Architecture design for multi-tenant isolation
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:hello@viswaroop.dev?subject=Inquiry:%20Identity%20Migration" class="btn-outline">Inquire</a>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Service 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-white/5 hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-3 text-white">Platform Engineering Advisory</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          For teams struggling with Kubernetes sprawl and deployment friction. I help establish GitOps paved roads that prioritize developer velocity without sacrificing reliability guardrails.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@viswaroop.dev?subject=Inquiry:%20Platform%20Engineering" class="text-accent font-medium hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
          Let's talk <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
